---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// Cloudflare Pages answers an unmatched request with `/404.html` *and* a 404 status — but only
// when that file exists in the output directory. Without it every unknown URL is served from
// `/index.html` with a 200 ("soft 404"), which lets Google index junk and inflates pageviews.
// `src/pages/404.astro` is the only page that does not live under a locale prefix, so it is
// bilingual (EN first, JA below) and `noindex` — the layout still gives it GA and the banner.
---

<Layout
	lang="en"
	title="Page not found (404) — Pip24h"
	description="The page you are looking for does not exist or has moved."
	noindex
>
	<section id="not-found" class="mx-auto max-w-2xl py-10">
		<p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-blue">404</p>
		<h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy dark:text-white">Page not found</h1>
		<p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
			The page you are looking for does not exist, has moved, or the address was mistyped.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy dark:text-white">ページが見つかりません</h2>
		<p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
			お探しのページは存在しないか、移動した可能性があります。下のリンクから目的のページをお探しください。
		</p>

		<div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<a
				href="/en/"
				class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 hover:border-brand-blue dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"
			>
				<span class="font-semibold text-brand-navy dark:text-white">Top Brokers (EN)</span>
				<span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Broker reviews and comparison table</span>
			</a>
			<a
				href="/ja/"
				class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 hover:border-brand-blue dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"
			>
				<span class="font-semibold text-brand-navy dark:text-white">トップブローカー (JA)</span>
				<span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">ブローカーレビューと比較表</span>
			</a>
			<a
				href="/en/reviews/"
				class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 hover:border-brand-blue dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"
			>
				<span class="font-semibold text-brand-navy dark:text-white">All reviews (EN)</span>
				<span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Forex and crypto broker reviews</span>
			</a>
			<a
				href="/ja/reviews/"
				class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 hover:border-brand-blue dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"
			>
				<span class="font-semibold text-brand-navy dark:text-white">全レビュー (JA)</span>
				<span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">FX・暗号資産ブローカーのレビュー一覧</span>
			</a>
		</div>

		<p class="mt-8 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
			If you followed a link from another site, it may be outdated. Start again from the
			<a href="/en/" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline">homepage</a> or the
			<a href="/ja/" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline">Japanese homepage</a>.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
